{
 "note": "Mutants of the bridge for food (include/ants_ai/island_tasks.hpp, src/ants_ai/island_tasks.cpp, docs/BOTS.md 'Islands') for tools/mutate.py (docs/TESTING.md, 'Mutation checks'). Run from the checkout with a configured build folder: python3 tools/mutate.py tests/data/bot_island_food_mutants.json --keep-going --jobs 1 --timeout 900. Every mutant must be caught. Each is caught by the case named in expect; the baseline runs all the cases of the batch (AI41).",
 "defaults": {
  "build": "test_ai"
 },
